    "Consider adding one dedicated core exercise per session, or one extra core set per week, to better support your growing leg and back strength as loads continue to climb.",
    "Maintain your current recovery habits — the consistent gains across all muscle groups suggest your body is responding and adapting well, and protecting that recovery will be key to sustaining this progress at age 46."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "All six muscle groups improved their strength index this period, with legs, glutes, and back leading gains; volume was well distributed but core and shoulders remain lightly loaded relative to the rest of the program."
}
